  "description": "PIWBAA crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 41 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C224 H160 Eu9 F16 O42. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 10 O neighbors; Eu1F (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2F (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3F (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4F (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.585-5.101 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 84.46-169.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu9C224H169F16O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
